{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_004354_p22_b8", "persona_id": "db:22", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "1. 避免机械复述：用户明确要求停止重复时，必须立即切换策略，否则会激怒客户。", "difficulty_rating": 6, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_004907"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_004354_p22_b8", "persona_id": "db:22", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "2. 核心异议必须闭环：用户提出认证编号异议后，应现场展示认证信息或提供可验证的即时证据，而非仅承诺后续发送。", "difficulty_rating": 6, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_004907"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_004354_p22_b8", "persona_id": "db:22", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "3. 控制S2阶段时长：S2阶段占比不应超过30%，一旦确认需求应迅速推进到S3处理异议，避免在S2反复确认。", "difficulty_rating": 6, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_004907"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_004354_p22_b8", "persona_id": "db:22", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "4. 使用SPIN问题链：在S2阶段应依次使用场景、问题、影响、收益问题，而非单一复述。", "difficulty_rating": 6, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_004907"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_004354_p22_b8", "persona_id": "db:22", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "5. 尊重客户时间：客户设定最后期限时，应确认并承诺，同时尝试在期限内完成交易，避免被动等待。", "difficulty_rating": 6, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_004907"}
